    4. Interactive PK/PD Simulator (Tab 3): Live Chart.js tool running the UMP/2B-Alert Bateman equation to simulate circulating drug mass Mc(t) and reaction time alertness P(t) based on custom doses and CYP1A2 genotype.
    5. Pharmacokinetics & Delivery Mechanics (Tab 4): Interactive deep-dive into sublingual vs volumetric oral spray kinetics based on the McCarthy 2025 trial and connected hardware actuators.
    6. Clinical Indications Explorer (Tab 5): Multi-vertical viewer comparing Caffeine/Hydration, ADHD Tachyphylaxis/Sensitization (with interactive SKAMP profile chart), and Precision Oncology Chronotherapy.
    7. 2026 Regulatory Diagnostic Engine (Tab 6): Interactive decision tree tool where users select system inputs/outputs to test FDA classification under Jan 2026 General Wellness, CDS, and Oct 2026 PDURS guidance.
    WHY: This non-linear, task-oriented layout allows engineers, clinicians, and regulatory teams to synthesize complex multi-disciplinary systems without drowning in dense text. -->
