                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Biometric Sensing Architecture & Operating System Throttles</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    This section demonstrates the physiological and technical limitations of gathering real-time telemetry from smartwatches. Building a functional microdosing platform requires engineering around the <strong>non-invasive glucose and hydration sensor gaps</strong>, as well as resolving <strong>OS-level background wake throttles</strong> and cross-platform mathematical metric incompatibilities.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Ingestion Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                
                <!-- Sensor Hardware Gap Card -->
                <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-4">
