                        <div class="p-3 bg-indigo-50/50 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100">
                            <span class="font-bold text-indigo-900 text-sm block mb-1">Background Wake Throttle (60-Minute Latency)</span>
                            <p class="text-slate-600">Neither HealthKit nor Health Connect is a real-time streaming API. iOS throttles background health notifications to a maximum frequency of <strong>once per hour</strong>. Relying purely on health hub background wakes causes dose notifications to lag biological tiredness by 30–60 minutes. Production engines require a custom companion <strong>watchOS/WearOS daemon</strong> running an active background workout session.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div class="p-3 bg-rose-50/50 rounded-lg border border-rose-100">
                            <span class="font-bold text-rose-900 text-sm block mb-1">The HRV Mathematical Failure Mode (SDNN vs. RMSSD)</span>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 mb-2">Autonomic stress algorithms rely heavily on Heart Rate Variability. However, Apple and Google compute incompatible mathematical metrics:</p>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono">
                                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded border border-slate-200">
                                    <strong class="text-slate-900 block">Apple HealthKit</strong>
