                                </div>
                                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded border border-slate-200">
                                    <strong class="text-slate-900 block">Google Health / WearOS</strong>
                                    Stores RMSSD (Root Mean Square of Successive Differences)
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-slate-600 mt-2">When Google Health v5.05 enabled iOS sync, it <em>omitted outbound HRV conversion</em>. An AI engine ingesting cross-platform data without raw beat-to-beat RR extraction will calculate invalid autonomic fatigue states.</p>
