                <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">Algorithmic Engine: Two-Tier Hybrid Grey-Box Simulator</h2>
                <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                    Unconstrained deep neural networks fail at scheduling drug microdoses due to cold-start data sparsity and pharmacokinetic non-stationarity. Production systems deploy a <strong>Two-Tier Architecture</strong>: Tier 1 executes the US Army's deterministic <strong>Unified Model of Performance (UMP / 2B-Alert)</strong> differential equations, while Tier 2 executes Bayesian phenotyping and Uncertainty-Aware Reinforcement Learning (UA-PPO) to personalize metabolic parameters and look ahead at calendar schedules.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Simulator Card -->
            <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-6">
                <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 pb-4 border-b border-slate-200">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-lg">Interactive PK/PD & Alertness Simulator</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Simulate Bateman Caffeine Plasma Curves $M_c(t)$ and Reaction Time Alertness $P(t)$</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase">CYP1A2 Genotype</label>
                            <select id="sim-genotype" onchange="updateSimulator()" class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500">
                                <option value="fast">AA Allele (Fast Metabolizer: t½ ~ 3.0 hrs)</option>
                                <option value="slow">CC Allele (Slow Metabolizer: t½ ~ 9.0 hrs)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-700 uppercase">Dosing Strategy</label>
                            <select id="sim-strategy" onchange="updateSimulator()" class="mt-1 text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-100 border border-slate-300 rounded px-2.5 py-1.5 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500">
                                <option value="bolus">1x Single Bolus (200mg Coffee at 08:00)</option>
                                <option value="micro">4x Microdoses (25mg at 08:00, 10:30, 13:00, 15:30)</option>
                                <option value="late">Late Microdose Failure (50mg at 18:30)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Chart Wrapper -->
                <div class="chart-container">
                    <canvas id="pkpdChart"></canvas>
                </div>

                <!-- Dynamic Math Formula Context -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 text-xs">
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block mb-1">Bateman PK Differential Eq:</span>
                        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-700">M_c(t) = Σ c_j * (k_a/(k_a - k_e)) * (e^(-k_e*Δt) - e^(-k_a*Δt))</p>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Calculates circulating plasma drug mass over 24 hours.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block mb-1">UMP Alertness Equation:</span>
                        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-700">P(t) = [S(t) + κ*C(t)] * g_PD(t, M_c)</p>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Combines Homeostatic sleep pressure S(t) and Circadian pacemaker C(t).</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
                        <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 block mb-1">UA-PPO Reward Function:</span>
                        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] text-slate-700">R = -w1*max(0, P-Pmax)² - w2*c_t - w3*SleepDisrupt</p>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">Reinforcement learning policy penalizing high-reaction times and bedtime drug residue.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>


